'''Shitakiri Sparrow''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]] event. It was added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]] increases health, damage and [[Wave Attack#Mini-Wave|Mini-Wave]] chance to 100%. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]].

