==Trivia==
*Shitakiri Sparrow is based on the story of [[wikipedia:Shita-kiri Suzume|Shita-kiri Suzume]], the story of a kind and selfless old man who helps nurse an injured sparrow back to health and is rewarded for it, as opposed to the man's wife who dismisses the sparrow and even cuts out its tongue after it was found eating her starch, eventually leading to the woman's demise.
*Chunchun Haunters are a reference to the popular [[wikipedia:Ghostbusters|Ghostbusters]] film, with the ghosts in this case being replaced by [[wikipedia:Yōkai|Yokai]].
**The three figures below the machinery are in order from left to right: [[wikipedia:Yūrei|Yūrei]], [[wikipedia:Hitotsume-kozō|Hitotsume-kozō]] and [[wikipedia:Rokurokubi|Rokurokubi]].
**The Yūrei Cat in particular resembles a [[mariowiki:Boo|Boo]] from the Mario Franchise.

